# Code structure

| Unit | Warn | Hard |
|---|---|---|
| File | 300 lines | 500 (prefer ≤450) |
| Function | 40 | 75 |
| Nesting | — | 3 |

**Do not grow:** `QuoteForm.tsx` (~687), `BlogContent.tsx`, `ContactContent.tsx`, `SettingsForm.tsx`. Split before adding features.
